****************************************************
* 05_moderation_interactions.do
* Moderation and interaction implementation after C5 approval.
****************************************************

* Continuous-by-continuous moderation using factor variables.
xtreg $Y_MAIN c.$FOCAL##c.$MODERATOR $CONTROLS i.$TIME_ID if $SAMPLE_MAIN, fe vce(cluster $CLUSTER_ID)
estimates store M_mod_1

* Joint test of interaction terms if multiple terms generated by factor notation.
testparm c.$FOCAL#c.$MODERATOR

* Simple slopes / marginal effects. Replace values with approved percentiles or theoretical values.
* Example values should be generated from observed moderator distribution.
quietly summarize $MODERATOR if e(sample), detail
local z_p10 = r(p10)
local z_p50 = r(p50)
local z_p90 = r(p90)
margins, dydx($FOCAL) at($MODERATOR=(`z_p10' `z_p50' `z_p90')) post
estimates store M_mod_1_margins
marginsplot, name(M_mod_1_plot, replace)
graph export "$FIGURES/M_mod_1_marginsplot.pdf", replace

* Treatment-by-continuous moderator template.
* xtreg $Y_MAIN i.TREAT##c.MODERATOR $CONTROLS i.$TIME_ID if $SAMPLE_MAIN, fe vce(cluster $CLUSTER_ID)
* margins, dydx(TREAT) at(MODERATOR=(p10 p50 p90))

* Categorical moderator template.
* xtreg $Y_MAIN c.$FOCAL##i.GROUP $CONTROLS i.$TIME_ID if $SAMPLE_MAIN, fe vce(cluster $CLUSTER_ID)
* margins GROUP, dydx($FOCAL)
* contrast r.GROUP#c.$FOCAL

* Nonlinear models: do not interpret interaction coefficient alone.
* poisson Y_COUNT c.$FOCAL##c.$MODERATOR $CONTROLS i.$TIME_ID if $SAMPLE_MAIN, vce(cluster $CLUSTER_ID)
* margins, dydx($FOCAL) at($MODERATOR=(`z_p10' `z_p50' `z_p90'))
